1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,400
Meet FrameShot: the free screen recorder
and full-page screenshot tool for Chrome.

2
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:07,913
Capture. Record. Annotate. Share.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,918
Need the whole page, not just
what fits on your screen?

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:17,961
Click Full page. FrameShot scrolls and
stitches every part into one sharp image.

5
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:23,702
Sticky headers show once, lazy images
load first, and your page is restored.

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,692
Or grab just the part you need: the
visible area, a selection, or one element.

7
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,275
Then explain it in seconds.

8
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,160
Highlight what matters,

9
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,817
box the number that counts,

10
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,854
add a note with an arrow,

11
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,382
and number every step.

12
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,491
Every mark stays editable.

13
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:50,785
Sharing something private? Blur it.

14
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,550
FrameShot tells you
when blur isn't enough,

15
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:56,138
a solid box removes it from the file.

16
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,101
Now, record your screen.

17
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,411
With sound, plus your camera.

18
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:01,950
Three.

19
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:02,925
Two.

20
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,863
One.

21
00:01:04,450 --> 00:01:07,250
Record a tab, a window,
or your whole screen,

22
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:10,026
with your mic and the tab or system sound,

23
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:13,350
plus a webcam bubble you
can move while you record.

24
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:17,850
Pause anytime. It saves as you go,
so a crash won't lose your take.

25
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,813
Stop, and it's ready to play.

26
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:24,142
Turn any moment into a GIF,
made right on your computer.

27
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:27,568
Pick the size and frame rate,
and it's ready to share.

28
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:33,683
Make it look good enough to post, with
backgrounds, padding, shadows and a browser frame.

29
00:01:36,250 --> 00:01:39,400
Screenshots and recordings
live in one library.

30
00:01:39,450 --> 00:01:43,160
Search it, sort it into
collections, and find duplicates.

31
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:48,650
It's private by design: no
account, no uploads, no tracking.

32
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:52,190
Everything stays on your
computer, and it works offline.

33
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:55,850
FrameShot. Capture the
web. Edit every detail.

34
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:58,458
Free forever. Add it to Chrome today.
